  "content": "<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Craftify-Mod/Assets/main/Header%20Card.png\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\">\n<center>\n <h2>Craftify 是一款 Minecraft 模组，可让您连接音乐服务并在游戏中显示和控制它们。</h2>\n</center><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aWRoBp4.png\">\n<center>\n <h3>自 1.6.0 版本起，1.18+ 版本不再使用 Essential</h3>\n</center>\n<center>\n <h3>Fabric 版本需要 Fabric API 和 Fabric Language Kotlin</h3>\n</center><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\">\n<blockquote>\n <h1>功能特色</h1>\n <h4>💻 歌曲显示</h4>\n <h4>🎨 主题</h4>\n <h4>📚 主题库</h4>\n <h4>🔔 歌曲通知/消息</h4>\n <h4>🔊 完整控制面板界面</h4>\n</blockquote><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\">\n<blockquote>\n <h1>支援服务</h1>\n <h4>🟢 Spotify</h4>\n <h4>🍎 Apple Music（通过 Cider.sh）</h4>\n <h4>📺 YouTube（通过 YTMD）</h4>\n <h4>👽 Foobar &amp; DeaDBeeF（通过 beefweb）</h4>\n <h4>🌊 Tidal（通过 Tidal-HiFi）</h4>\n</blockquote><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\">\n<center>\n <h3>💻 歌曲显示与控制面板 🔊</h3>\n</center><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s569O65.png\">\n<center>\n <p>像素化主题由 Mo2men 制作</p>\n</center><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\">\n<blockquote>\n <h1>制作团队</h1>\n <h3>💻 开发者 - ThatGravyBoat</h3>\n <h3>🎨 装饰图标 - Twemoji</h3>\n <h3>⛔ 缺失歌曲图标 - Twemoji</h3>\n <h3>💿 图标与页面美术 - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/vindocel/projects\">VindoCel</a></h3>\n</blockquote><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\"> <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/gravy\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Craftify-Mod/Assets/main/BisectHosting%20Card.png\"> </a>",
